          "गोपवर्य: जगौ\tthe leading Gopa said"
        ],
        "iast": [
          "tatropanandābhidhagopavaryo jagau bhavatpreraṇayaiva nūnam |",
          "ita: pratīcyāṃ vipinaṃ manojñaṃ vṛndāvanaṃ nāma virājatīti ||2||",
